 photo #2 (even better)","my cousin''s testimony (he was THERE)","a diagram i made"]},{"t":"img","caption":"[ diagram: the ridge, three circles, many arrows, the word \"WHY??\" ]"},{"t":"p","text":"I am not crazy. I am ORGANIZED."},{"t":"badges","labels":["CITYPAGES MEMBER","KAVA POWERED","ANTI-FRAME LEAGUE"]},{"t":"counter","value":9118},{"t":"updated","date":"September 30, 1997"},{"t":"webring","ring":"The Valley Web Ring","prevUrl":"www.citypages.net/~poet_of_the_pines","nextUrl":"www.citypages.net/~moonbeam_pages"}]}},{"id":"web.gen.moonbeam_pages","kind":"webpage","name":"SOLAR FLARE shrine","meta":{"url":"www.citypages.net/~moonbeam_pages","siteTitle":"SOLAR FLARE 4-EVER (Moonbeam''s shrine)"},"searchText":"SOLAR FLARE fan shrine band moonbeam_pages","body":{"style":{"bg":"#ffeeee","fg":"#331111","link":"#990000","accent":"#cc3366","font":"sans","centered":true},"blocks":[{"t":"blink","text":"*** THE UNOFFICIAL SOLAR FLARE SHRINE ***"},{"t":"h","text":"SOLAR FLARE 4-EVER"},{"t":"p","text":"i have seen them 4 times. yes i cried. no i will not elaborate."},{"t":"divider","kind":"dots"},{"t":"img","caption":"[ 47 photos, each one takes 3 minutes to load, worth it ]"},{"t":"sub","text":"Why they are the best (a partial list):"},{"t":"list","items":["the lyrics UNDERSTAND me","my mom even likes them","saw them live and my life changed"]},{"t":"midi","file":"wedding_march.mid"},{"t":"badges","labels":["Y2K READY (almost)","MIDI INSIDE","FREE SPEECH ONLINE"]},{"t":"guestbook","count":70},{"t":"counter","value":31347},{"t":"webring","ring":"The Valley Web Ring","prevUrl":"www.citypages.net/~gearhead_gary","nextUrl":"www.citypages.net/~miss_kitty_meow"}]}},{"id":"web.gen.miss_kitty_meow","kind":"webpage","name":"Denise''s poetry corner","meta":{"url":"www.citypages.net/~miss_kitty_meow","siteTitle":"Whispers of the Pines — poetry by Denise"},"searchText":"poetry poems writing miss_kitty_meow pines whispers","body":{"style":{"bg":"#000022","fg":"#ccffcc","link":"#66ffff","accent":"#ff66cc","font":"serif","centered":true},"blocks":[{"t":"h","text":"Whispers of the Pines"},{"t":"small","text":"original poetry by Denise. please do not steal my poems. i will know."},{"t":"divider","kind":"dots"},{"t":"sub","text":"\"The Reservoir\""},{"t":"p","text":"the fog comes down the valley / like a secret nobody asked for / and the town pretends not to notice / (it notices)"},{"t":"small","text":"(c) 1997. all rights reserved. seriously."},{"t":"guestbook","count":16},{"t":"updated","date":"August 4, 1997"},{"t":"webring","ring":"The Valley Web Ring","prevUrl":"www.citypages.net/~moonbeam_pages","nextUrl":"www.citypages.net/~radioactive_dave"}]}},{"id":"web.gen.radioactive_dave","kind":"webpage","name":"SOLAR FLARE shrine","meta":{"url":"www.citypages.net/~radioactive_dave","siteTitle":"SOLAR FLARE 4-EVER (Dave''s shrine)"},"searchText":"SOLAR FLARE fan shrine band radioactive_dave","body":{"style":{"bg":"#ccffff","fg":"#003333","link":"#cc0066","accent":"#006666","font":"serif","centered":true,"bgTile":"plaid"},"blocks":[{"t":"blink","text":"*** THE UNOFFICIAL SOLAR FLARE SHRINE ***"},{"t":"h","text":"SOLAR FLARE 4-EVER"},{"t":"p","text":"i have seen them 4 times. yes i cried. no i will not elaborate."},{"t":"divider","kind":"rainbow"},{"t":"img","caption":"[ 14 photos, each one takes 3 minutes to load, worth it ]"},{"t":"sub","text":"Why they are the best (a partial list):"},{"t":"list","items":["track 5. just listen to track 5.","saw them live and my life changed","better than everything else combined"]},{"t":"midi","file":"sk8ordie.mid"},{"t":"badges","labels":["Y2K READY (almost)","FREE SPEECH ONLINE","NetVoyager NOW","GET WESTWIND"]},{"t":"guestbook","count":194},{"t":"counter","value":11083},{"t":"webring","ring":"The Valley Web Ring","prevUrl":"www.citypages.net/~miss_kitty_meow","nextUrl":"www.citypages.net/~sk8_or_dye"}]}},{"id":"web.citypages-directory","kind":"webpage","name":"CityPages member directory","meta":{"url":"www.citypages